  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for Code 39 from Word is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan Code 39 barcode from Word in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode Code 39 data message from Word file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
